          {
            "title": "Question: After variable",
            "id": 82834,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa fa <code>split()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Divide una stringa in un elenco</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Unisce una stringa</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Sostituisce una parte di una stringa</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Divide una stringa in un elenco.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un programma esegue <code>\"Ada Lin\".split()</code>. Quale valore restituisce la chiamata?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">L'elenco <code>['Ada', 'Lin']</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">La stringa <code>AdaLin</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">La stringa <code>Ada Lin</code> con lo spazio sostituito</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere L'elenco <code>['Ada', 'Lin']</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Replace",
            "id": 82810,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sostituisci tutte le occorrenze di <code>!</code> con <code>?</code>. </p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"rep = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Yes!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"rep = rep.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(rep)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"^\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Yes?\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"</code>, seguito da <code>?</code> e infine <code>\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sostituisci ogni <code>!</code> con <code>?</code> affinché la console mostri <code>Yes?</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"rep = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Yes!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"rep = rep.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(rep)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;?&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"^\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Yes?\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"!\"</code>, seguito da <code>\"</code>, <code>?</code> e infine <code>\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Reuse",
            "id": 82809,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Riassegna alla variabile originale il valore aggiornato.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"yearly = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Discount increased to 2%&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"yearly = yearly.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;2%&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;4%&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(yearly)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"43\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Discount increased to 4%\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>yearly</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Replace",
            "id": 82806,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiorna la variabile <code>release_date</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"release_date = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Release date: 24th July&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"updated = release_date.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;24th July&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;31st August&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(updated)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"count\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"split\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Release date: 31st August\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>release_date</code>, seguito da <code>replace</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sostituisci la vecchia data con quella nuova affinché la console mostri <code>Release date: 31st August</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"release_date = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Release date: 24th July&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"updated = release_date.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;24th July&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;31st August&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(updated)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"count\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"split\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;31st August&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Release date: 31st August\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>release_date</code>, seguito da <code>replace</code> e infine <code>\"24th July\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Displaying",
            "id": 82802,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa succede quando assegniamo nuovamente alla variabile originale il risultato restituito da <code>replace()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">La variabile contiene il valore aggiornato e possiamo usarla normalmente</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Provocherà un errore nel nostro codice</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Il valore all'interno della variabile originale non verrà aggiornato </item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">La variabile contiene il valore aggiornato e possiamo usarla normalmente.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un programma memorizza <code>draft report</code> in <code>title</code>, quindi assegna <code>title.replace(\"draft\", \"final\")</code> di nuovo a <code>title</code>. Cosa contiene ora <code>title</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>final report</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>draft report</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Un errore perché title aveva già un valore</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>final report</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
